# BioInterchange 2.0.5 (commit 49d57012): the brewsci/bio Homebrew bottle for x86_64 Linux, a GHCR
# blob addressed by its SHA-256, on Debian bullseye (it links Python 3.9 and OpenSSL 1.1). The
# JSON-LD context is vcf-f1.json from the pinned commit; the URLs the output names return 404.
CONV_BI_BASE_IMAGE="debian:bullseye-slim@sha256:e5b6442dd2e9684cf5e87d8338b5968f3b348636fc0be6d7850a381e3731a2bd"
